<mxCell id="c3c43" value="Each move rules out every remaining pair that uses the discarded value, so L and R together take at most N steps: &lt;b&gt;O(N) time, O(1) space&lt;/b&gt; instead of O(N²) for all pairs. Only valid on sorted input." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="466" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
